# Next.js 16 (PharmLMS)

This project uses **Next.js 16** with breaking changes vs older versions. Before writing Next.js code, read the relevant guide in `node_modules/next/dist/docs/`.

## Tooling

- Use **pnpm** (`pnpm run dev`, `pnpm dlx`, not npx).
- Dev script uses webpack: `pnpm run dev`.

## App Router

- Use the App Router only (`app/`). No Pages Router.
- `searchParams` and `params` in page/layout props are **Promises** — always `await` them.
- Prefer Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only when needed (hooks, browser APIs, event handlers).
- Use `redirect()` / `notFound()` from `next/navigation` in server code.
- Colocate route handlers in `app/api/`.
- Use `revalidatePath` / `revalidateTag` after server mutations.

## Data & auth

- Database access via `@/lib/db` or `@/lib/prisma` — never import Prisma in client components.
- Auth via `@/auth` and portal-specific guards (`requireAdminSession`, role checks).
- Preserve existing RBAC paths (`/student`, `/tutor`, `/mentor`, `/admin`).

## Deprecations

- Heed deprecation notices in Next 16 docs before using APIs from training data.
